| ID | Date | Change | Approved By | Rollback | Status |
|----|------|--------|------------|----------|--------|
<!-- | CHG-001 | 2026-01-15 | Add VLAN 60 for IoT | Network Admin | Remove VLAN config | Completed | -->

### Change Process
1. Request (describe change, impact, rollback plan)
2. Review (peer review, manager approval)
3. Schedule (maintenance window)
4. Execute (with monitoring)
5. Verify (test connectivity, check alerts)
6. Document (update this file, diagrams, NetBox)
